{"unit_id":"tag:0ETK:statement","translation":"任意 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）都是 V 覆盖（covering）。因而，任意 fppf、合成（syntomic）、光滑（smooth）、平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）或 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）都是 V 覆盖（covering）。此外，ph 覆盖（covering）也是 V 覆盖（covering）。\n","allowed_english":["V","fppf","ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ETK:proof","translation":"fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）在仿射（affine）局部可被标准 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）细化（refined），见引理<REF_0001>。标准 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）是标准 V 覆盖（covering），见引理<REF_0002>。因此，第一个陈述由用标准 V 覆盖（coverings）定义 V 覆盖（covers）的定义推出。关于 fppf、合成（syntomic）、光滑（smooth）、平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）或 Zariski 覆盖（coverings）的结论成立，因为这些都是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc coverings），见引理<REF_0003>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n关于 ph 覆盖（coverings）的陈述以相同方式由引理<REF_0004>推出。\n","allowed_english":["V","fppf","Zariski","ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"refined","target_term":"细化"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covers","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"refined","target_term":"细化","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covers","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ETL:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是反变函子（contravariant functor），定义在概形（schemes）的范畴（category）上，取值于集合（sets）。称<MATH_0002><TEXTITOPEN_0001>对 V 拓扑满足层性质（satisfies the sheaf property for the V topology）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若它对任意 V 覆盖（covering）满足层性质（sheaf property）（见定义<REF_0001>）。\n","allowed_english":["V"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"contravariant functor","target_term":"反变函子"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"satisfies the sheaf property for the V topology","target_term":"对 V 拓扑满足层性质"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"contravariant functor","target_term":"反变函子","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"satisfies the sheaf property for the V topology","target_term":"对 V 拓扑满足层性质","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
