{"unit_id":"tag:0ETN:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的拟紧（quasi-compact）态射（morphism）。以下条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>是 V 覆盖（covering），\n<STRUCT_0003> 对任意赋值（valuation）环（ring）<MATH_0003>和态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>，存在赋值（valuation）环（rings）的扩张（extension）<MATH_0005>和交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0006>，\n<STRUCT_0004> 对任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>和特化（specialization）<MATH_0008>，其点（points）位于<MATH_0009>中，存在特化（specialization）<MATH_0010>，其点（points）位于<MATH_0011>中，映到（mapping）<MATH_0012>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":["V"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"valuation","target_term":"赋值"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"valuation","target_term":"赋值"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"specialization","target_term":"特化"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"specialization","target_term":"特化"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"mapping","target_term":"映到"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"valuation","target_term":"赋值","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"待决"},{"source