{"unit_id":"tag:0ETA:prose-0006","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nV 覆盖（covering）给出普遍次浸（universally submersive）的映射（maps）族（family）。此引理的逆命题不成立，见《例》节<REF_0001>。\n\n","allowed_english":["V"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"universally submersive","target_term":"普遍次浸"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"universally submersive","target_term":"普遍次浸","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ETP:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是 V 覆盖（covering）。则<MATH_0002>是概形（schemes）的普遍次浸（universally submersive）态射（morphism）（《态射（Morphisms）》定义<REF_0001>）。\n","allowed_english":["V"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"universally submersive","target_term":"普遍次浸"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"universally submersive","target_term":"普遍次浸","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ETP:proof","translation":"我们将使用 V 覆盖（covering）的基变换（base change）仍是 V 覆盖（covering）（引理<REF_0001>），以后不再说明。特别地，只须证明该态射（morphism）是次浸（submersive）的。次浸（submersive）性显然在基底（base）上是 Zariski 局部的。因此，可假设<MATH_0001>仿射（affine）。于是<MATH_0002>可被标准 V 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0003>细化（refined）。若可证明<MATH_0004>是次浸（submersive）的，则由于存在分解（factorization）<MATH_0005>，得到<MATH_0006>是次浸（submersive）的。置<MATH_0007>，并考虑仿射概形（affines）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>。由引理<REF_0002>，知道可将任意特化（specialization）<MATH_0009>，它在<MATH_0010>中，提升（lift）为某个特化（specialization）<MATH_0011>，它在<MATH_0012>中。因此，若<MATH_0013>是子集（subset），使得<MATH_0014>在<MATH_0015>中闭，则<MATH_0016>对特化（specialization）封闭。由于<MATH_0017>带有既约（reduced）的诱导闭子概形（closed subscheme）结构时是仿射概形（affine scheme），得到<MATH_0018>是闭的，由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0003>得到。因此，<MATH_0019>是次浸（submersive）的。\n","allowed_english":["V","Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"submersive","target_term":"次浸"},{"source_term":"submersive","target_term":"次浸"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refined","target_term":"细化"},{"source_term":"submersive","target_term":"次浸"},{"source_term":"factorization","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"submersive","target_term":"次浸"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"specialization","target_term":"特化"},{"source_term":"lift","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"specialization","target_term":"特化"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"specialization","target_term":"特化"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"既约"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"闭子概形"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"sourc