{"unit_id":"tag:03FF:statement","translation":"取任意范畴（category）<MATH_0001>，其构造如《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0001>所述，从概形（schemes）的集合（set）<MATH_0002>出发。选择任意覆盖（coverings）的集合（set）<MATH_0003>，定义在<MATH_0004>上，如《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0002>所述，从范畴（category）<MATH_0005>和 fppf 覆盖（coverings）的类（class）出发。令<MATH_0006>表示由此得到的大 fppf 景（site）。接下来，对<MATH_0007>，令<MATH_0008>具有与<MATH_0009>相同的底层范畴（underlying category），其覆盖（coverings）<MATH_0010>仅由<MATH_0011>-覆盖（coverings）的子集（subset）组成。容易核验，这给出大景（site）<MATH_0012>。\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
